# Raw salvage pulled off the convert host — unsanitised (absolute paths, host
# names) AND the proprietary native leap-graph construction. Kept locally as the
# recovery source of record; never published. The recipes here document the
# methodology and acceptance, not the full graph source.
.salvage/

# Model artefacts. None are redistributed from this repo — a recipe rebuilds them,
# or an A-tier package is downloaded (see README "Getting the compiled models").
# LLM/VLM .hbm are GB-scale.
*.hbm
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
embed_tokens*.bin

# Calibration / reference data is regenerated by each model's calib from public
# sources or a real forward pass.
cal/
cal_*/
*.npz
*.npy

# Compile by-products
*_out/
*.hbo
*.log

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Local machine paths / source locations (mirrors bcdl's local.env convention)
local.env

# This repo's own publishing contract — its header says "private — never
# published"; it was tracked+pushed by mistake since 2026-07-23. Local only.
PUBLISHING.md

# Staging area for Hugging Face model-card drafts (published directly to HF,
# not part of this repo's own publishing contract — see PUBLISHING.md)
.hf_staging/
